## Section 4 — Philosophy

`backend/knowledge/rag.py :: knows_transaction()` is the "do I already know
this?" gate. It returns one of:

| level | action |
|---|---|
| `complete` | **reuse** |
| `partial` | **update** only what is needed |
| `unknown` / `stale` / `low_confidence` | **record** |

Every agent calls `retrieve()` (`backend/agents/base.py`) before any LLM call —
retrieval-before-generation is enforced by the base class, not by convention.

