## Section 5 — Recorder engine

| Spec | Code |
|---|---|
| 5.1 page-level capture | `injector.js :: crawlPage()`, `cdp_recorder._ingest_crawl` |
| 5.2 whole-page element crawl | `injector.js :: CRAWL_SELECTOR` + `collectRoots()` (shadow DOM, iframes) |
| 5.3 locator repository | `injector.js :: describe()` → `backend/recorder/locator_builder.py` |
| 5.4 DOM snapshots before/after | `cdp_recorder._snapshot_dom`, `snapshot_store.dom_diff` |
| 5.5 screenshots | `cdp_recorder._screenshot` |
| 5.6 workflow path | `cdp_recorder._workflow` |
| 5.7 input metadata, never raw values | `injector.js` change handler sends `value_length`/`sensitive` only |
| 5.8 validation rules | `injector.js :: captureMessages()` → `validation_rules` table |
| 5.9 network activity | `cdp_recorder._drain_network` (CDP performance log) |
| 5.10 versioning | `backend/knowledge/versioning.py :: open_new_version` — never overwrites |
| 5.11 Keep / Discard | `recording_graph` interrupt + `POST /api/recorder/decide` |

The injector is re-installed via `Page.addScriptToEvaluateOnNewDocument` so it
survives navigation, and is pushed into every iframe on each poll.

