## Section 6 — Code generation

`backend/codegen/generator.py :: generate_all()` produces, per transaction:

- `Transaction_<id>/Transaction<id>.feature`
- `pages/Transaction<id>Page.java`
- `steps/Transaction<id>Steps.java`
- `runners/Transaction<id>Runner.java` — **pure Java**
- `test-data/<ENV>/transaction_<id>.json`

Before writing anything it queries the Framework Index (Section 8) and skips any
step definition that already exists, recording what it reused. Hand-written code
between `// === CUSTOM CODE START/END ===` is extracted and re-injected on every
regeneration, so the AI extends the framework and never clobbers your work.

