## Section 7 — Test Data Management

| Spec | Code |
|---|---|
| 7.1 banking data is user-supplied | `tdm/field_meta.py :: USER_ONLY`; `AI_ALLOWED = {"REMARKS"}` |
| 7.2 field metadata | `field_meta.build()` → `test_data_fields` table |
