| 7.4 per-transaction/per-environment templates | `tdm/templates.py` |
| 7.5 variables, never literals | `codegen/templates/feature.j2` + `TestDataReader.resolve()` |
| 7.6 data profiles | `tdm/profiles.py`, `test_data_profiles` table |
| 7.7 AI Data Resolver | `resolver.resolve()` → `write_runtime_file()` |
| 7.8 frontend editor | `frontend/testdata.html`, `templates.editor_view()` |

Sensitive values never touch the JSON file — it carries `__ENCRYPTED__` and the
real value lives Fernet-encrypted in `test_data_values`.

