## Section 13 — Reporting

`backend/reporting/report_builder.py` + `templates/report.html.j2`. Self-contained
HTML (screenshots base64-inlined) with transaction/environment/profile, expandable
step-by-step results, the 9750 sub-step, the teller-reset result and CBS response,
self-healing before/after diffs, timing metrics, and links back to the knowledge
version used.

