## Section 14 — Frontend

Plain HTML/CSS/JS, no framework, no build step. `frontend/js/api.js` holds the
shared client, the sidebar renderer and the WebSocket helper; each screen is one
self-contained page.

`record.html` · `library.html` · `testdata.html` · `profiles.html` · `brd.html` ·
`execute.html` · `reports.html` (+ `index.html` overview).

Live feeds: `ws://…/api/recorder/live` and `ws://…/api/execution/live`.

