## Section 15 — Storage

`db/schema.sql` — 18 tables: `transactions`, `pages`, `elements`, `locators`,
`recorded_actions`, `validation_rules`, `test_data_fields`, `test_data_profiles`,
`test_data_values`, `secrets`, `executions`, `execution_steps`, `self_heal_log`,
`brd_uploads`, `framework_artifacts`, `framework_methods`, `framework_relations`,
`ai_decisions`, `approvals`, `recording_sessions`, `knowledge_embeddings`.

The vector column dimension follows `EMBEDDING_DIM` and is rewritten at schema
apply time if you switch embedding models.

